# System calls virtiofsd 1.13.3 allows itself (its own seccomp filter, src/seccomp.rs), which the
# container's seccomp profile allows too: virtiofsd's calls depend on what the VM does with its
# files, and its own filter fixes them. Left out: name_to_handle_at and open_by_handle_at (RunCVM
# runs virtiofsd with --inode-file-handles=never) and unshare (with --sandbox=chroot, not namespace).
# The version line below must match the virtiofsd that RunCVM builds: the build fails otherwise.
# Update this list from the new version's src/seccomp.rs when Alpine's virtiofsd changes.
